{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-03-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARKEM-IMAJE INTRODUCES ETHERNET PROTOCOL AND IMAGE CREATION CAPABILITY TO ITS 4700 VALVEJET PRINTER', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , MARCH 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ – MARKEM-IMAJE, PART OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) AND A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF END-TO-END SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS AND INDUSTRIAL MARKING AND CODING SYSTEMS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE INTRODUCTION OF AN ETHERNET PROTOCOL AND IMAGE CREATION CAPABILITY TO PROVIDE GREATER CONNECTIVITY TO ITS 4700 VALVEJET DROP-ON-DEMAND PRINTER.'}